  "created": "2025-03-28T13:05:34.913Z",
  "description": "DSL.Reqnroll is Reqnroll plugin that enables use of dynamic test data in Reqnroll steps by bringing in custom and environment variables, regular expressions and bespoke transformations. It's a re-write of SpecFlow.DSL library, written originally by Wenyuan(Ryan) Song and Liam Flanagan, to align it with Reqnroll with some enhncements on top of it.\n\n\t\t\tCapabilities:\n\t\t\t-> Retrieve value of environment variables\n\t\t\t-> Create dynamic test data and refer it in another step\n\t\t\t-> Create dynamic test data using regular expression\n\t\t\t-> Simple calculations via bespoke transformations",
  "id": "DSL.Reqnroll",
